{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"储能","country":"越南","country_iso":"VNM","created_at":"2026-07-02T13:21:11.104628","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"VNM-ES-0002","ldc":"No","location":"","location_norm":"","name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"越南110MWh储能项目","project_name_en":"Vietnam 110MWh Energy Storage Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"瑞源电气","content":"近日，瑞源电气成功与越南北方电力总公司（EVNNPC）达成合作，成功签约110MWh大型电网侧储能项目，该项目不仅是EVNNPC首批储能示范项目，也是EVN首次和越南之外的国际公司签约储能项目，同时也是瑞源电气首个落地的海外EPC项目。\n本次合作，瑞源电气依托全栈自研核心储能技术，为项目输出覆盖设计建设、设备供货、调试运维的全生命周期一体化解决方案。项目配套核心为公司自主研发的集中式储能系统，包含5MWh电池舱与储能变流升压一体舱，凭借集成度高、能量转换效率高、全域安全防护等多项优势，适配东南亚高温高湿的特殊气候。产品已获得CE、UN多项国际权威认证，并已在多个国家和地区成功投运。\n该项目建成后，可满足越南电网调峰、调频、平抑新能源出力波动等多元化应用需求，有效解决新能源消纳难题，全方位提升越南北部电网的稳定性与灵活性，大幅提高当地可再生能源消纳能力。\n瑞源电气积极响应国家“一带一路”绿色发展倡议，将东南亚市场作为国际化发展的重点区域之一。未来，公司将持续深耕越南市场，稳步推进属地化战略布局，搭建本土合作生态、完善海外服务团队，进一步提升客户服务能力和项目交付能力。\n越南北方电力总公司（EVNNPC）隶属于Vietnam Electricity，负责越南北部27个省市的配电网络建设与运营，是越南国家电网体系的重要组成部分。越南EVNNPC 110MWh储能项目是越南国家电网推进储能产业发展的重要里程碑项目。","content_sha256":"4f13abb290844a56cce910f38cf9f166808fdd0951518010b279711b022460d1","id":26888,"publish_date":"2026-06-22 13:33:01","title":"瑞源电气签约越南EVNNPC 110MWh储能项目，深化东南亚新能源布局","title_sha256":"58f421c4ce7033779d66d16a156d4481b1cf7313453f0c642fe8d4d40ad33593","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/95843.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"VNM-ES-0002","capacity_details":"储能110MWh","capacity_mw":110.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"110.0","capacity_source":"original","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-07-02T13:21:11.110570","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"VNM-ES-0002-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"越南北方电力总公司","project_developer_en":"Northern Vietnam Power Corporation","project_stage":"签约","project_summary":"瑞源电气在越南签约了110MWh储能项目，以EPC总承包方式提供主要设备，包括5MWh电池舱和储能变流升压一体舱。","publish_date":"2026-06-22 13:33:01","pv_capacity_mw":null,"source_links":"[\"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/95843.html\"]","storage_energy_mwh":110.0,"storage_power_mw":null,"total_investment_usd":null,"total_investment_usd_raw":"","transmission_capacity_mw":null,"verification_confidence":null,"verification_sources":null,"verification_status":"unverified","voltage_kv":null}}],"evidence_policy":{"exact_quote_required":true,"quote_must_not_cross_surfaces":true,"valid_surfaces":["title","body"]},"project_id":"VNM-ES-0002","schema_version":"storage-taxonomy-evidence-package-v1","selection_reasons":["existing_storage_numeric","storage_text_signal"]}
